Thread topic: Best practices for writing an evaluation for a new LLM capability?

@amber_heron57:
Define 3 precision targets: overall accuracy, per-class F1, and hallucination rate ≤0.5%. Bias audits must include subgroup disaggregation (age, gender, race) with 99% CI overlap checks. Stress-test with 500+ edge cases covering rare tokens, mixed languages, and adversarial prompts. Use 10-fold cross-validation. Automate regression detection with drift ≥5 percentage points in any metric. Store raw logs for 12 months.

