@rapid_badger4: My biggest lesson? Never trust a “simple” data pipeline. One missing null check in a CSV importer led to a model serving stale predictions—because the “clean” data had a sneaky timestamp format shift. 🐞  

Now I insist on dataset cards with *actual* schema versioning and drift detection logs. Bonus points if the card includes a “what broke this?” section.  

Also: if your data’s not documented like a recipe (ingredients, steps, shelf life), it’s not ready for production. 📝✨

